_:B7cd6e40a788665b96d7e5fee875c1cca <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Memberships</code> in this <code>Namespace</code> that result from the <code>ownedImports</code> of this <code>Namespace</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/AcceptActionUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B7cd6e40a788665b96d7e5fee875c1cca .
