_:B3874accbe704004feec9a8113307780b <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An <code>Expression</code> whose <code>result</code> is bound to the <code><em>payload</em></code> <code>parameter</code> of this <code>AcceptActionUsage</code>. If provided, the <code>AcceptActionUsage</code> will only accept a <code><em>Transfer</em></code> with exactly this <code><em>payload</em></code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/AcceptActionUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B3874accbe704004feec9a8113307780b .
