_:B11b755d70c828e0fd5edd791e2f9b5f2 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An <code>Expression</code> whose <code>result</code> is bound to the <em><code>receiver</code></em> input <code>parameter</code> of this <code>AcceptActionUsage</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
