_:Be70379902bf3bc1f8f3733ec4b2c71c6 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#isVariation> .
_:Be70379902bf3bc1f8f3733ec4b2c71c6 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
