_:B0fc12abafe655ee90fdfad06741d6bef <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B0fc12abafe655ee90fdfad06741d6bef <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
