_:B12437fb3db604ab0f87e0203465f6dbd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B12437fb3db604ab0f87e0203465f6dbd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
