_:B6cc0c51d3fcf71156f6276a41433c774 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B6cc0c51d3fcf71156f6276a41433c774 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
