_:B9d1e8432e3391bbcfce908e9264e0fc2 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B9d1e8432e3391bbcfce908e9264e0fc2 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Usage</code> is for a variation point or not. If true, then all the <code>memberships</code> of the <code>Usage</code> must be <code>VariantMemberships</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/AnalysisCaseUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B9d1e8432e3391bbcfce908e9264e0fc2 .
