<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/AssertConstraintUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B33d1b2608710d73323f310d8f49d2a0d .
_:Bfe274a42b7f69293d31c298eded11fb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
