_:B39bf4647755272e1883d0f67d4fd9f90 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "variantMembership" .
_:B39bf4647755272e1883d0f67d4fd9f90 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
