_:Be8954cb00ec25e5c960eea83364599ee <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> which represent the variants of this <code>Definition</code> as a variation point <code>Definition</code>, if <code>isVariation</code> = true. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, the there must be no <code>variants</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
