_:Be7411c156bfb11979195d0ea62b8720b <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>ownedMemberships</code> of this <code>Definition</code> that are <code>VariantMemberships</code>. If <code>isVariation</code> = true, then this must be all <code>ownedMemberships</code> of the <code>Definition</code>. If <code>isVariation</code> = false, then <code>variantMembership</code>must be empty."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/AttributeDefinitionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Be7411c156bfb11979195d0ea62b8720b .
