<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/BehaviorShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>Behavior </code>coordinates occurrences of other <code>Behaviors</code>, as well as changes in objects. <code>Behaviors</code> can be decomposed into <code>Steps</code> and be characterized by <code>parameters</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/BehaviorShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "BehaviorShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
