<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/BindingConnectorShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>BindingConnector</code> is a binary <code>Connector</code> that requires its <code>relatedFeatures</code> to identify the same things (have the same values)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
