<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/CalculationDefinitionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>CalculationDefinition</code> is an <coed>ActionDefinition that also defines a <code>Function</code> producing a <code>result</code>.</coed>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
