_:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "isVariation" .
_:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Exactly-one> .
_:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#isVariation> .
_:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Usage</code> is for a variation point or not. If true, then all the <code>memberships</code> of the <code>Usage</code> must be <code>VariantMemberships</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/CalculationUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Be91ce7f8b56750f6085e5e52564cced4 .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "isModelLevelEvaluable" .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Exactly-one> .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#isModelLevelEvaluable> .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Expression</code> meets the constraints necessary to be evaluated at <em>model level</em>, that is, using metadata within the model."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/CalculationUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B2ff284969dc00ed36b016cb1be6bbd82 .
