_:B3ea989511a134200accd90d95ad00fa7 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "intersectingType" .
_:B3ea989511a134200accd90d95ad00fa7 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
