_:Bca7364f1abffeeb5fa1f3a5b6e4904fa <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:Bca7364f1abffeeb5fa1f3a5b6e4904fa <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
