_:B8580929e5d434bd5a79fa419b37c76d7 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Definition</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
