_:Bb83bf96b5c6e6fbd21b06f36d92b3016 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>OccurrenceUsage</code> represents the usage of the specific individual represented by its <code>individualDefinition</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
