_:Bfc9f8dbdb0a0ddc2c4c779c17d405d32 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:Bfc9f8dbdb0a0ddc2c4c779c17d405d32 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:Bfc9f8dbdb0a0ddc2c4c779c17d405d32 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> which represent the variants of this <code>Usage</code> as a variation point <code>Usage</code>, if <code>isVariation = true</code>. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, then there must be no <code>variants</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
