<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ConnectorAsUsageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>ConnectorAsUsage</code> is both a <code>Connector</code> and a <code>Usage</code>. <code>ConnectorAsUsage</code> cannot itself be instantiated in a SysML model, but it is a base class for the concrete classes <code>BindingConnectorAsUsage</code>, <code>SuccessionAsUsage</code>, <code>ConnectionUsage</code> and <code>FlowConnectionUsage</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
