_:B8c0a1cf7489c4a4bf75c13f7885895d8 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Expression</code> meets the constraints necessary to be evaluated at <em>model level</em>, that is, using metadata within the model."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ConstraintUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B8c0a1cf7489c4a4bf75c13f7885895d8 .
