<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ConstructorExpressionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>ConstructorExpression</code> is an <code>InstantiationExpression</code> whose <code>result</code> specializes its <code>instantiatedType</code>, binding some or all of the <code>features</code> of the <code>instantiatedType</code> to the <code>results</code> of its <code>argument</code> <code>Expressions</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
