_:B9270107eb2ad47b6a66cde7e70427371 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "chainingFeature" .
_:B9270107eb2ad47b6a66cde7e70427371 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
