<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/DataTypeShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>DataType</code> is a <code>Classifier</code> of things (in the universe) that can only be distinguished by how they are related to other things (via Features). This means multiple things classified by the same <code>DataType</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
