<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/EnumerationUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B673e8570d5cb578d4e98427ed871d745 .
_:Bede74dbc3c939b8be11c355ae9474e53 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
