_:Bede74dbc3c939b8be11c355ae9474e53 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Feature> .
_:Bede74dbc3c939b8be11c355ae9474e53 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:Bede74dbc3c939b8be11c355ae9474e53 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
