_:Becf8bc01e9a9247a6c2d84e781f2f15e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:Becf8bc01e9a9247a6c2d84e781f2f15e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:Becf8bc01e9a9247a6c2d84e781f2f15e <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Usage</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
