<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/EventOccurrenceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bdd68b67ad9ca422b10301bfa94af3063 .
_:B9340a659efbd2cc2c6608bf0767d78d2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B9340a659efbd2cc2c6608bf0767d78d2 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "intersectingType" .
_:B9340a659efbd2cc2c6608bf0767d78d2 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B9340a659efbd2cc2c6608bf0767d78d2 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#intersectingType> .
