<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ExhibitStateUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bfb586f14f4ba29019457f6409a8aec53 .
_:B9d5a351d76aaccc147d62c21696d15cc <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B9d5a351d76aaccc147d62c21696d15cc <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "entryAction" .
