_:B70ca4f1edcee299a625aa05ae8602480 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Type</code> that is the <code>owningType</code> of the <code>owningFeatureMembership</code> of this <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/FeatureChainExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B70ca4f1edcee299a625aa05ae8602480 .
_:B2c34eeaecb7824270f2d892c1e767992 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
