_:B177e54f1ca895c782e250690b197ce87 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Feature</code> that is referenced by this <code>FeatureReferenceExpression</code>, which is its first non-<code>parameter</code> <code>member</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
