<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/FeatureReferenceExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B61d42d98cca6dfb5ca618d346546d1e9 .
_:Be9e6bfedf3853f0be9ec8803738a0cf0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:Be9e6bfedf3853f0be9ec8803738a0cf0 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "chainingFeature" .
_:Be9e6bfedf3853f0be9ec8803738a0cf0 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
