<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ForLoopActionUsageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>ForLoopActionUsage</code> is a <code>LoopActionUsage</code> that specifies that its <code>bodyAction</code> <code>ActionUsage</code> should be performed once for each value, in order, from the sequence of values obtained as the result of the <code>seqArgument</code> <code>Expression</code>, with the <code>loopVariable</code> set to the value for each iteration."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
