_:B90cf93e5ebd5d4837e4510caeec52829 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#parameter> .
_:B90cf93e5ebd5d4837e4510caeec52829 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Feature> .
_:B90cf93e5ebd5d4837e4510caeec52829 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
