_:B9297122679055ca9ae7ff902238e4f0c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B9297122679055ca9ae7ff902238e4f0c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
