_:Bfc6cf74188a117f6ff15aa57f4d816f0 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The parameters of this <code>Behavior</code>, which are defined as its <code>directedFeatures</code>, whose values are passed into and/or out of a performance of the <code>Behavior</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
