<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/FunctionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>Function</code> is a <code>Behavior</code> that has an <code>out</code> <code>parameter</code> that is identified as its <code>result</code>. A <code>Function</code> represents the performance of a calculation that produces the values of its <code>result</code> <code>parameter</code>. This calculation may be decomposed into <code>Expressions</code> that are <code>steps</code> of the <code>Function</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/FunctionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "FunctionShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
