_:B955521b6d84741603b94b3aca7f1855d <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Usage</code> is for a variation point or not. If true, then all the <code>memberships</code> of the <code>Usage</code> must be <code>VariantMemberships</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/InterfaceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B955521b6d84741603b94b3aca7f1855d .
