_:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Type</code> that is the <code>owningType</code> of the <code>owningFeatureMembership</code> of this <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/InvocationExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B39d39b92d6337852ce452025d2dc7802 .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "chainingFeature" .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#chainingFeature> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Feature> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Feature</code> that are chained together to determine the values of this <code>Feature</code>, derived from the <code>chainingFeatures</code> of the <code>ownedFeatureChainings</code> of this <code>Feature</code>, in the same order. The values of a <code>Feature</code> with <code>chainingFeatures</code> are the same as values of the last <code>Feature</code> in the chain, which can be found by starting with the values of the first <code>Feature</code> (for each instance of the domain of the original <code>Feature</code>), then using each of those as domain instances to find the values of the second <code>Feature</code> in chainingFeatures, and so on, to values of the last <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/InvocationExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B00ddca9aafe079177983401e5c4cca8c .
