_:Bfb92510ca69bdc03084c179c780eedc3 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#intersectingType> .
_:Bfb92510ca69bdc03084c179c780eedc3 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
