_:Bf334b5800d33b4009c6c2a483d876f37 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:Bf334b5800d33b4009c6c2a483d876f37 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "unioningType" .
_:Bf334b5800d33b4009c6c2a483d876f37 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
