_:B5cd8a424284cb562f1817d0cfa79235f <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B5cd8a424284cb562f1817d0cfa79235f <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
