<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LibraryPackageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>LibraryPackage</code> is a <code>Package</code> that is the container for a model library. A <code>LibraryPackage</code> is itself a library <code>Element</code> as are all <code>Elements</code> that are directly or indirectly contained in it."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
