<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralBooleanShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B4a752c6d72d5e91ced827c97eed82ba1 .
_:B62081c58768a10ff9b23b4060749775d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
