_:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "<code>Types</code> that feature this <code>Feature</code>, such that any instance in the domain of the <code>Feature</code> must be classified by all of these <code>Types</code>, including at least all the <code>featuringTypes</code> of its <code>typeFeaturings</code>.  If the <code>Feature</code> is chained, then the <code>featuringTypes</code> of the first <code>Feature</code> in the chain are also <code>featuringTypes</code> of the chained <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B53f74569bdce9b3f5f8d6074c10b4f61 .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "type" .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#type> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "<code>Types</code> that restrict the values of this <code>Feature</code>, such that the values must be instances of all the <code>types</code>. The types of a <code>Feature</code> are derived from its <code>typings</code> and the <code>types</code> of its <code>subsettings</code>. If the <code>Feature</code> is chained, then the <code>types</code> of the last <code>Feature</code> in the chain are also <code>types</code> of the chained <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B027feb0dcd3c5dbdc35e09644e34a400 .
_:Bbca71edf4384aa0b4386b5e6e151a955 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:Bbca71edf4384aa0b4386b5e6e151a955 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "owningType" .
