_:B262eb5d669eca634a2fa1189e35bcdcd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B262eb5d669eca634a2fa1189e35bcdcd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#chainingFeature> .
