<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralIntegerShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>LiteralInteger</code> is a <code>LiteralExpression</code> that provides an <code><em>Integer</em></code> value as a result. Its <code>result</code> <code>parameter</code> must have the type <code><em>Integer</em></code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
