_:B71ed6525e23bb8f9a1575b571fb1f00f <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#isModelLevelEvaluable> .
_:B71ed6525e23bb8f9a1575b571fb1f00f <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B71ed6525e23bb8f9a1575b571fb1f00f <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Expression</code> meets the constraints necessary to be evaluated at <em>model level</em>, that is, using metadata within the model."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralRationalShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B71ed6525e23bb8f9a1575b571fb1f00f .
_:B3821ec95a1852661becff196c6678f09 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
