_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "intersectingType" .
_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#intersectingType> .
_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:Bb63bb212a8dae6f69d7a723008a4310e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
