<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralRationalShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>LiteralRational</code> is a <code>LiteralExpression</code> that provides a <code><em>Rational</em></code> value as a result. Its <code>result</code> <code>parameter</code> must have the type <code><em>Rational</em></code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
