_:Bd17d10e6011885384edd8e1e5836a261 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:Bd17d10e6011885384edd8e1e5836a261 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "chainingFeature" .
_:Bd17d10e6011885384edd8e1e5836a261 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
