<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/LiteralStringShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B0f5078ef85e882a25a50c55521a094ee .
_:B8b81b43b27b8e0cb8458daa12025eb35 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
