_:B8b81b43b27b8e0cb8458daa12025eb35 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B8b81b43b27b8e0cb8458daa12025eb35 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#unioningType> .
