_:B675a196006d0df886dedc5a5312be7fc <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>OccurrenceUsage</code> represents the usage of the specific individual represented by its <code>individualDefinition</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MergeNodeShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B675a196006d0df886dedc5a5312be7fc .
