<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MergeNodeShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>MergeNode</code> is a <code>ControlNode</code> that asserts the merging of its incoming <code>Successions</code>. A <code>MergeNode</code> may have at most one outgoing <code>Successions</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
