_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "chainingFeature" .
_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#chainingFeature> .
_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Feature> .
_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B1cb99cff0c56e0a98717e6a2916a1394 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
