<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MetadataAccessExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bd08ef7f2b5a68bca486e4eef890b7b00 .
_:B7d23107a406f867603b1e4fe5ef6f343 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
