_:B24774c5ea91c0014402006903ada25f2 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>ownedMemberships</code> of this <code>Definition</code> that are <code>VariantMemberships</code>. If <code>isVariation</code> = true, then this must be all <code>ownedMemberships</code> of the <code>Definition</code>. If <code>isVariation</code> = false, then <code>variantMembership</code>must be empty."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
