<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MetadataFeatureShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>MetadataFeature</code> is a <code>Feature</code> that is an <code>AnnotatingElement</code> used to annotate another <code>Element</code> with metadata. It is typed by a <code>Metaclass</code>. All its <code>ownedFeatures</code> must redefine <code>features</code> of its <code>metaclass</code> and any feature bindings must be model-level evaluable."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MetadataFeatureShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "MetadataFeatureShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
