_:Bd51010dedadf18b5a8446fe5d5e8efa3 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> which represent the variants of this <code>Usage</code> as a variation point <code>Usage</code>, if <code>isVariation = true</code>. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, then there must be no <code>variants</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MetadataUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bd51010dedadf18b5a8446fe5d5e8efa3 .
_:B9d86f13a4325067bdc1de5ebd5a08446 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
