_:B73da168e9dae3cd1f1d96996c9f04204 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B73da168e9dae3cd1f1d96996c9f04204 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Usage</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/MetadataUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B73da168e9dae3cd1f1d96996c9f04204 .
