<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceDefinitionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B3376d632009d4f71f2228206b7595f78 .
_:B4eae8b8f8df1f30b970c3d71af2ed15f <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
