<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceDefinitionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An <code>OccurrenceDefinition</code> is a <code>Definition</code> of a <code>Class</code> of individuals that have an independent life over time and potentially an extent over space. This includes both structural things and behaviors that act on such structures. If <code>isIndividual</code> is true, then the <code>OccurrenceDefinition</code> is constrained to have (at most) a single instance that is the entire life of a single individual."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceDefinitionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "OccurrenceDefinitionShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
