_:Bbb5d476b093cd1b6e0b9b70c0dca65b5 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>ownedMemberships</code> of this <code>Usage</code> that are <code>VariantMemberships</code>. If <code>isVariation = true</code>, then this must be all <code>memberships</code> of the <code>Usage</code>. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, then <code>variantMembership</code>must be empty."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bbb5d476b093cd1b6e0b9b70c0dca65b5 .
