_:B14d873ffe5761f6d9ac9955d2e6414ef <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>usages</code> of this <code>Usage</code> that are <code>directedFeatures</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B14d873ffe5761f6d9ac9955d2e6414ef .
