_:B5a7fa0ce0674f998a6c0b498ef7f569f <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B5a7fa0ce0674f998a6c0b498ef7f569f <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>OccurrenceUsage</code> represents the usage of the specific individual represented by its <code>individualDefinition</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/OccurrenceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B5a7fa0ce0674f998a6c0b498ef7f569f .
_:Bcfbf0d9c959f8732e2d02f0c46c6b6d6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
