_:B452d0c077c7ea3793b454098f60bbe9c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B452d0c077c7ea3793b454098f60bbe9c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#featuringType> .
_:B452d0c077c7ea3793b454098f60bbe9c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B452d0c077c7ea3793b454098f60bbe9c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
