_:B17a4542b1ecb69650849605969854655 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Exactly-one> .
_:B17a4542b1ecb69650849605969854655 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#result> .
