_:Ba47a51bc419879d3ea66af3141214bfd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:Ba47a51bc419879d3ea66af3141214bfd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#unioningType> .
_:Ba47a51bc419879d3ea66af3141214bfd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:Ba47a51bc419879d3ea66af3141214bfd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
