<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PartDefinitionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>PartDefinition</code> is an <code>ItemDefinition</code> of a <code>Class</code> of systems or parts of systems. Note that all parts may be considered items for certain purposes, but not all items are parts that can perform actions within a system."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
