_:Bc51691af3e2a437ffd1fd00d8f208165 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Usage</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PartUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bc51691af3e2a437ffd1fd00d8f208165 .
_:Bf7fb2566a82e70257a16fdabfbbd45d1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
