_:Bf56751cfb021daabe43dec6f1ab26bcf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Memberships</code> in this <code>Namespace</code> that result from the <code>ownedImports</code> of this <code>Namespace</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PartUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bf56751cfb021daabe43dec6f1ab26bcf .
_:B1cada81423607cad5b43bc3acc4abb7c <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B1cada81423607cad5b43bc3acc4abb7c <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "unioningType" .
