<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PayloadFeatureShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B828e809f3bd324445a13bc645904ab10 .
_:B3d3edb136591c1d5e5047b38a94527b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
