<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PortDefinitionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B7e2e65c0e4abf531949ff547fecb551d .
_:B17d743ad01873aacb25da4c84cf2dd91 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B17d743ad01873aacb25da4c84cf2dd91 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "unioningType" .
_:B17d743ad01873aacb25da4c84cf2dd91 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
