<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PortDefinitionShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>PortDefinition</code> defines a point at which external entities can connect to and interact with a system or part of a system. Any <code>ownedUsages</code> of a <code>PortDefinition</code>, other than <code>PortUsages</code>, must not be composite."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
