_:B64c8396bee47f524d44ed5713240fd87 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "differencingType" .
_:B64c8396bee47f524d44ed5713240fd87 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B64c8396bee47f524d44ed5713240fd87 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
