<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PortUsageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>PortUsage</code> is a usage of a <code>PortDefinition</code>. A <code>PortUsage</code> itself as well as all its <code>nestedUsages</code> must be referential (non-composite)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
