_:Bac50da04a280a2ef4a010a5144d93edd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:Bac50da04a280a2ef4a010a5144d93edd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:Bac50da04a280a2ef4a010a5144d93edd <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:Bac50da04a280a2ef4a010a5144d93edd <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The parameters of this <code>Behavior</code>, which are defined as its <code>directedFeatures</code>, whose values are passed into and/or out of a performance of the <code>Behavior</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/PredicateShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bac50da04a280a2ef4a010a5144d93edd .
