<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ReferenceUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B62dd6f915904d06e6acc3f7b627f6d62 .
_:B9001e937ac3616a6b91db3cdf84fdc28 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
