_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "differencingType" .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B58144e7bcb45c63f3245618b4ce29ddb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
