_:B643d4daba020c328938f5b90c31bc8ec <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B643d4daba020c328938f5b90c31bc8ec <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>ownedMemberships</code> of this <code>Usage</code> that are <code>VariantMemberships</code>. If <code>isVariation = true</code>, then this must be all <code>memberships</code> of the <code>Usage</code>. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, then <code>variantMembership</code>must be empty."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
