_:B9046e25065209131680ff4841e0760e1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "type" .
_:B9046e25065209131680ff4841e0760e1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
