<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/RenderingUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Bb6c636f3eed0dfba5e777b37d7739795 .
_:Bcec1fcf9c8987e84cb67b4fcf1571b3b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
