_:Bacdb6ab4badef63e3be09549cfc2140f <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>parameter</code> of this <code>RequirementUsage</code> that represents its subject."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
