<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ReturnParameterMembershipShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>ReturnParameterMembership</code> is a <code>ParameterMembership</code> that indicates that the <code>ownedMemberParameter</code> is the <code>result</code> <code>parameter</code> of a <code>Function</code> or <code>Expression</code>. The <code>direction</code> of the <code>ownedMemberParameter</code> must be <code>out</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
