_:B604d81b9f6a463df29472806d9beaa2d <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The owned <code>ConstraintUsages</code> that represent assumptions of this <code>RequirementUsage</code>, derived as the <code>ownedConstraints</code> of the <code>RequirementConstraintMemberships</code> of the <code>RequirementUsage</code> with <code>kind</code> = <code>assumption</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/SatisfyRequirementUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B604d81b9f6a463df29472806d9beaa2d .
