_:Be424b38810659786c0fdf7e0d7ea80ee <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>parameters</code> of this <code>RequirementUsage</code> that represent stakeholders for the requirement."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/SatisfyRequirementUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:Be424b38810659786c0fdf7e0d7ea80ee .
