_:B1bf2f4d1edb6342a161b8c9c676d90fb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:B1bf2f4d1edb6342a161b8c9c676d90fb <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
