_:B6769893c9fe843c0490ac9609fabbd01 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B6769893c9fe843c0490ac9609fabbd01 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
_:B6769893c9fe843c0490ac9609fabbd01 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B6769893c9fe843c0490ac9609fabbd01 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
