_:B20488cbae26beaf4e82ef9b02da74781 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B20488cbae26beaf4e82ef9b02da74781 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#unioningType> .
_:B20488cbae26beaf4e82ef9b02da74781 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
