_:B38246763c3ef85fd09817a5195d0d432 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#isIndividual> .
_:B38246763c3ef85fd09817a5195d0d432 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B38246763c3ef85fd09817a5195d0d432 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>OccurrenceUsage</code> represents the usage of the specific individual represented by its <code>individualDefinition</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/StateUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B38246763c3ef85fd09817a5195d0d432 .
_:B1695d1f39cd596173e4390d185794dc2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
