_:B1615adaf61f95db0f0fa105537b9c432 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B1615adaf61f95db0f0fa105537b9c432 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>ActionUsage</code> of this <code>StateUsage</code> to be performed while in the state defined by the <code>StateDefinition</code>. It is the owned <code>ActionUsage</code> related to the <code>StateUsage</code> by a <code>StateSubactionMembership</code>  with <code>kind = do</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/StateUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B1615adaf61f95db0f0fa105537b9c432 .
