<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/StructureShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>Structure</code> is a <code>Class</code> of objects in the modeled universe that are primarily structural in nature. While such an object is not itself behavioral, it may be involved in and acted on by <code>Behaviors</code>, and it may be the performer of some of them."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
