<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/SubjectMembershipShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>SubjectMembership</code> is a <code>ParameterMembership</code> that indicates that its <code>ownedSubjectParameter</code> is the subject of its <code>owningType</code>. The <code>owningType</code> of a <code>SubjectMembership</code> must be a <code>RequirementDefinition</code>, <code>RequirementUsage</code>, <code>CaseDefinition</code>, or <code>CaseUsage</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
