<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/SuccessionFlowShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>SuccessionFlow</code> is a <code>Flow</code> that also provides temporal ordering. It classifies <code><em>Transfers</em></code> that cannot start until the source <code><em>Occurrence</em></code> has completed and that must complete before the target <code><em>Occurrence</em></code> can start."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/SuccessionFlowShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "SuccessionFlowShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
