_:Baca510d7e6d8279c6fcf14778ce93e48 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Usage</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
