_:B0c7736342d70f60fa62df23e455d3407 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Feature> .
_:B0c7736342d70f60fa62df23e455d3407 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B0c7736342d70f60fa62df23e455d3407 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
