_:B003d43d43a8bbc3ffa2037814a2e5fc6 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> which represent the variants of this <code>Usage</code> as a variation point <code>Usage</code>, if <code>isVariation = true</code>. If <code>isVariation = false</code>, then there must be no <code>variants</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
