_:B90f073d01189b6b9ba8e632cd579b2da <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>Usages</code> that are <code>features</code> of this <code>Usage</code> (not necessarily owned)."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TransitionUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B90f073d01189b6b9ba8e632cd579b2da .
