<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TransitionUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B57b2751d40c8038bd1bbe96c993437d5 .
_:B3f3ced4d8abdda111a2ec94e87d0f2d3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B3f3ced4d8abdda111a2ec94e87d0f2d3 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "intersectingType" .
_:B3f3ced4d8abdda111a2ec94e87d0f2d3 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B3f3ced4d8abdda111a2ec94e87d0f2d3 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#intersectingType> .
