<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TriggerInvocationExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B6fb5a7964960f34ece69fc9cf275c423 .
_:B924565d76d11612b849b982f5d7a9b0e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B924565d76d11612b849b982f5d7a9b0e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "unioningType" .
_:B924565d76d11612b849b982f5d7a9b0e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
