_:B0046292472f4608b72062727b361d0fc <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
_:B0046292472f4608b72062727b361d0fc <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "<code>Types</code> that feature this <code>Feature</code>, such that any instance in the domain of the <code>Feature</code> must be classified by all of these <code>Types</code>, including at least all the <code>featuringTypes</code> of its <code>typeFeaturings</code>.  If the <code>Feature</code> is chained, then the <code>featuringTypes</code> of the first <code>Feature</code> in the chain are also <code>featuringTypes</code> of the chained <code>Feature</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TriggerInvocationExpressionShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B0046292472f4608b72062727b361d0fc .
_:B48e8cf2e6f325790a4b5997f44e087d1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B48e8cf2e6f325790a4b5997f44e087d1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "intersectingType" .
_:B48e8cf2e6f325790a4b5997f44e087d1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B48e8cf2e6f325790a4b5997f44e087d1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#intersectingType> .
