<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TypeFeaturingShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> <https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/type> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TypeFeaturingShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>TypeFeaturing</code> is a <code>Featuring</code> <code>Relationship</code> in which the <code>featureOfType</code> is the <code>source</code> and the <code>featuringType</code> is the <code>target</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/TypeFeaturingShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "TypeFeaturingShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
