_:B72c6b4b903ea5c334c2bbbbc36fc8219 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B72c6b4b903ea5c334c2bbbbc36fc8219 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B72c6b4b903ea5c334c2bbbbc36fc8219 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
