_:Bfaa8b7be3154ca8f2c7a96d5351275f7 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
_:Bfaa8b7be3154ca8f2c7a96d5351275f7 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#valueType> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Resource> .
