_:B2b2ac631b83b211f88f2e8a3fa425068 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B2b2ac631b83b211f88f2e8a3fa425068 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
