_:B096b84d6576b7f64a880480c29ef6ee1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B096b84d6576b7f64a880480c29ef6ee1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
_:B096b84d6576b7f64a880480c29ef6ee1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B096b84d6576b7f64a880480c29ef6ee1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
_:B096b84d6576b7f64a880480c29ef6ee1 <http://open-services.net/ns/core#representation> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Either> .
