_:B6e9a8e2ec24e08bea61ebe409b4de1e0 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether this <code>Function</code> can be used as the <code>function</code> of a model-level evaluable <code>InvocationExpression</code>. Certain <code>Functions</code> from the Kernel Functions Library are considered to have <code>isModelLevelEvaluable = true</code>. For all other <code>Functions</code> it is <code>false</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
