_:B9fb8dfc40912e83583c3760f89e12ed9 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The <code>usages</code> of this <code>Usage</code> that are <code>directedFeatures</code>."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ViewUsageShape> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#property> _:B9fb8dfc40912e83583c3760f89e12ed9 .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#name> "differencingType" .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#occurs> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Zero-or-many> .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#propertyDefinition> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#differencingType> .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#range> <https://www.omg.org/spec/sysml/vocabulary#Type> .
_:B0204c57153d6fe336ce58a4741bb7d8e <http://open-services.net/ns/core#readOnly> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
