<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ViewUsageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A <code>ViewUsage</code> is a usage of a <code>ViewDefinition</code> to specify the generation of a view of the <code>members</code> of a collection of <code>exposedNamespaces</code>. The <code>ViewUsage</code> can satisfy more <code>viewpoints</code> than its definition, and it can specialize the <code>viewRendering</code> specified by its definition."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/ViewUsageShape> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "ViewUsageShape"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
