<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/isComposite> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether the <code>Feature</code> is a composite <code>feature</code> of its <code>featuringType</code>. If so, the values of the <code>Feature</code> cannot exist after its featuring instance no longer does and cannot be values of another composite feature that is not on the same featuring instance."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
