<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/isPortion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether the values of this <code>Feature</code> are contained in the space and time of instances of the domain of the <code>Feature</code> and represent the same thing as those instances."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/isUnique> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
