<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/isUnique> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Whether or not values for this <code>Feature</code> must have no duplicates or not."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
<https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/shapes/isVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://open-services.net/ns/core#Property> .
